  "question": {
    "text": "If the normal to the ellipse&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is at a distance <math><mi>p</mi></math> from the origin, then the maximum value of <math><mi>p</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the normal is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi></mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>θ</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
  }
